MID_SE_Led_Guj_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_001: Well, hello there! How's about you and me grab\nsome lunch?
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_002: Oh, here we go. I'm not going anywhere with an\nobnoxious man like you.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_003: Whoa, hold on. I'm not that obnoxious. I've got a\nheart of gold. A real solid reputation!
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_004: You're kidding, right? You must remember the last\ntime we saw each other.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_005: I was playing my vihuela at a tavern, and you came\nup and said, "Hey, lemme play my song. It's great!"
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_006: I knew you'd remember! Yeah, now I catch your\ndrift. You want to hear it again.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_007: What? No. Why would I want that?
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_008: Ahem! OK, here goes...
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_009: ♪Guzran ran ran Guuuuz ran! He's the kinda guy\nyou can really count on!♪
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_010: Ugh. No one should be made to listen to that.\nAnd it's not even the same song!
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_011: Sorry, my bad. That one was Heroic Ode to\nGuzran, Number 12!
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_012: Hahaha! You know my whole catalogue though,\nhuh? Figured you did. Just testing you!
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_013: Aaand I have a headache in full swing. Last time you\nonly mentioned 10 Odes to Guzran.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_014: Yeah, I broke past 10. Crushed 11. It's 12-O\nand beyond-O for this guy!
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_015: Like I said—obnoxious. I'm done here.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_016: Huh? Oh, yeah, yeah. Back to lunch! Just you, me,\nand my be-eau-ti-ful voice!
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_017: No! And your voice is not beautiful!
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_018: Whoa, tough customer. Didn't mean to give ya\ngrief. You've got a real...hangry look there.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_019: Whose fault would that be?
MID_SE_Led_Guj_C_020: OK, OK... I hear you, loud and clear-O!
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_001: The Lady Leda... I trust you're in excellent spirits\non this fine day?
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_002: I was, until an annoying lout showed up and soured\nmy mood. Would you just go away?
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_003: Aw, come on! Aren't you interested in having the\nstrongest mercenary around to guard you?
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_004: The strongest mercenary, huh? When are they\ngetting here?
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_005: You know what—fine. If you're so tough, you can\nprove it by fighting me.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_006: Yeah! I'm up for some of that. Let's get this\nparty started!
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_007: Ready? Hrah!
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_008: No problem!
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_009: Hmph. So, you're not strong enough to beat me...\nbut you're not all talk either.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_010: Haha! A compliment! You're not so bad yourself.\nBuccar taught you well.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_011: Y-yes. He did. You met Buccar?
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_012: Yeah, in passing. But he talked about you. Actually,\nhe wanted me to keep something in mind.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_013: I see... So, you were being honest about wanting to\nguard me. And I suppose he recognized your ability.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_014: Seems unwarranted, though... It's not as if I've\never needed guarding.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_015: Everyone needs some guarding—sometimes. But\nyeah, Buccar was just looking out for you.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_016: Yes, I guess so. Well, after all that sparring, I've\nworked up an appetite. Want to go eat?
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_017: Haha, look at that! You asked ME out!
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_018: Really, I'd just like to hear any more stories you have\nabout Buccar.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_019: Uh, about that...
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_020: Yes? What is it?
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_021: He didn't ASK me to guard you. He, uh...told me to\nbe on guard if I was stupid enough to ask you out.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_022: Say that again?
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_023: But I like the way you think—asking li'l ol' me out\nlike this. Come on! Let's get our feed bag on!
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_024: Ugh. Smooth! Why are you such a sleaze all\nthe time?!
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_025: Heh, that Leda, spirited as ever... Hmm. For now it\nlooks like you have no need to worry, Buccar.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_026: I'll keep an eye on her though, as you asked.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_027: She's not the type who's going to open up—not to\nme anyway. But I will do my best.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_028: Well, she shot me down. S'pose I'll have to drown\nmy sorrows with you, Demon Bear... Huh?
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_029: You owe me for this little favor. But I guess I'll\nhave to collect at your grave... Huh?
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_030: I've decided I don't want to risk running into\nyou again. So I'm going to chop off your head.
MID_SE_Led_Guj_B_031: Haha! You think you can kill the Unkillable Guzran?\nFriend, I like your fire! Let's keep it burning!